# tail23 bomb chain v2: give bombs, lay two on the Cyclops' floor, lift the ball out of the height
# band, place the Cyclops on the bombs (InMaxRange -> mBombId -> mVulnerable), powerbomb damage,
# struggle while attached (Dizzy / BallCloseToCollision), then each beam at the other Cyclops.
@f600 tp 148 213.3 -13.0
@f620 give morphBallBombs 1
@f640 press x 20
@f680 press a 1 ; press a 1 ; objs CBomb
@f694 tp 148 211 -11
@f700 objs CBomb ; trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f710 place u047b 148 213.3 -13.2
@f720 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f730 obj u047b
@f740 damage u047b 2000 powerbomb
@f750 obj u047b
@f760 status
@f800 tp 148 213.3 -13.0
@f820 trigcall u047b InDetectionRange
@f840 stick 127 0 6 ; stick -127 0 6 ; stick 127 0 6
@f860 stick -127 0 6 ; stick 127 0 6 ; stick -127 0 6
@f880 stick 127 0 6 ; stick -127 0 6
@f900 obj u047b
@f920 trigcall u047b IsDizzy
@f940 statecall u047b Dizzy 0
@f960 statecall u047b Dizzy 1
@f980 statecall u047b GetUp 1
@f1000 statecall u047b GetUp 0
@f1020 statecall u047b GetUp 2
@f1040 trigcall u047b InMaxRange
@f1060 obj u047b
@f1100 tp 148 211 -11
@f1120 beam power ; shoot u047b 2
@f1160 beam dark ; shoot u047b 2
@f1200 beam light ; shoot u047b charged 2
@f1240 beam annihilator ; shoot u047b charged 2
@f1280 damage u047b 5000 powerbomb
@f1320 obj u047b
@f1340 obj u0455
@f1360 beam power ; shoot u0455 2
@f1400 damage u0455 5000 powerbomb
@f1440 kill u047b
@f1480 obj u047b
@f1520 status
@f1560 trigcall u0455 InMaxRange
@f1600 statecall u0455 GetUp 1
@f1640 trigcall u0455 SpotPlayer
@f1680 status
